      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Value for hyphenation frequency indicating the full amount of automatic hyphenation with using faster algorithm. This option is useful for running text and where it's important to put the maximum amount of text in a screen with limited space. To make text rendering faster with hyphenation, this algorithm ignores some hyphen character related typographic features, e.g. kerning.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/text/Layout#HYPHENATION_FREQUENCY_FULL_FAST" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.text.Layout.HYPHENATION_FREQUENCY_FULL_FAST</code>.</a></format></para>
